# SEO keywords for articles and guides

Before you write or retitle an article, explainer, or situation page, read [`SEO.md`](SEO.md).

- One page, one primary query. Put it in the H1, document title, and slug.
- Use close variants in the body of that page only.
- Do not chase gratitude journal, journaling prompts, or another brand's name.
- Ad scenes (Slack, kids asleep, the driveway) are not search queries. Do not force them into an H1.
- Copy rules in `website/.cursor/rules/no-em-dashes.mdc` still apply. Matching a query is not an excuse to stuff, contrast, or therapize.
